<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Upstream strings that upstream's own Japanese translation lacks.

  Every key here exists in res/values/*.xml (strings.xml, strings_account.xml,
  strings_preferences.xml, strings_content_description.xml, strings_certificate.xml,
  strings_call.xml, arrays.xml) but in none of upstream's res/values-ja/*.xml files.
  They are kept in this one fork-owned file so that upstream's values-ja files stay
  untouched and a rebase does not conflict.

  When a sync brings one of these keys into upstream's own values-ja file, the build
  reports a duplicate resource — delete that entry from HERE.

  The two string-arrays at the end are copies of the default arrays with their prose
  items translated. Item order and count must stay identical to res/values/arrays.xml
  (swarm_one_to_one_actions is indexed by ActionHelper.ACTION_*): when the default
  array changes, change the copy here too.
-->
